# What the village remembers about Edmund Fenn, the player's great-uncle who left them the farm (playtest request, 2026-10-05).
# One topic per villager, asked once. In the base game these are plain, kind memories. The Keepers' lines read differently on a second
# playthrough (the cult chose Edmund; see docs/mythos/LORE.md), but nothing here says so: the horror belongs to Farm.Mythos.

topic edmund.tilda
  npc tilda
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.tilda
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.tilda
n0 tilda: Edmund bought his seed here every March for forty years. Never haggled. Never forgot a name.
  next n1
n1 tilda: I put a parsnip packet on his tab last winter out of habit. It's still there. I can't bring myself to close it.
  expr sad
  tag wholesome

topic edmund.marcus
  npc marcus
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.marcus
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.marcus
n0 marcus: I built that porch for him. He paid me in pickles and said it was a fair rate.
  next n1
n1 marcus: He asked me to leave the cellar door as it was. Wouldn't even let me oil the hinge.
  tag mystery

topic edmund.odalys
  npc odalys
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.odalys
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.odalys
n0 odalys: Edmund was my patient for years. Sound heart, stubborn knees.
  next n1
n1 odalys: He told me last fall that he'd put his affairs in order. I thought he meant the paperwork.
  expr thinking
  tag mystery

topic edmund.dorian
  npc dorian
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.dorian
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.dorian
n0 dorian: We traded mushrooms for apples. He never once asked where I found mine.
  next n1
n1 dorian: Tell you what I miss. He'd stand at the edge of your field at dusk and just... look at the trees. Like he was counting them.
  tag mystery

topic edmund.wren
  npc wren
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.wren
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.wren
n0 wren: Edmund had a stool here too. Second from the door, so he could leave early. He always left early.
  next n1
n1 wren: Last time, he stayed for the whole of Piper's set. Bought a round. I should have guessed.
  expr sad
  tag wholesome

topic edmund.hazel
  npc hazel
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.hazel
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.hazel
n0 hazel: Edmund borrowed one book a year. The same one. (He renewed it by post.)
  next n1
n1 hazel: It's overdue now. I've decided that it isn't.
  expr embarrassed
  tag wholesome

topic edmund.bram
  npc bram
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.bram
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.bram
n0 bram: Hm. Edmund. Sharpened his scythe every spring. Wouldn't let me do it.
  next n1
n1 bram: Said a man ought to know his own edge. Good man.
  tag wholesome

topic edmund.juno
  npc juno
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.juno
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.juno
n0 juno: He ordered a tiny brass key from me once. Said it was for a box he'd lost the lock to.
  next n1
n1 juno: I charged him half. He paid double the next week and wouldn't say why. Honestly the nicest man.
  tag surprise

topic edmund.piper
  npc piper
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.piper
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.piper
n0 piper: Edmund hummed one tune, always the same four notes. I tried to finish it for him once.
  next n1
n1 piper: He said, "Leave it open. Some songs are better unfinished." I play those four notes before every set now.
  emote note
  tag wholesome

topic edmund.elara
  npc elara
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.elara
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.elara
n0 elara: He used to bring the clinic a basket of eggs whenever he came for his checkup.
  next n1
n1 elara: The last basket had a card in it. Just "thank you for everything." I keep it in my drawer.
  expr sad
  tag wholesome

topic edmund.felix
  npc felix
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.felix
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.felix
n0 felix: Edmund never fished a day in his life. Came by every Friday anyway to hear how the fish were doing.
  next n1
n1 felix: Told him they were thriving. He seemed relieved. Odd man. I liked him.
  tag funny

topic edmund.ione
  npc ione
  label Ask about Edmund Fenn
  plays edmund.ione
  priority 3
  once

dialogue edmund.ione
n0 ione: Edmund left the library his almanacs. Forty years of them, every margin written in.
  next n1
n1 ione: Hazel says the notes stop in the fall. The last page just says, "Done well enough." I find I read it a lot.
  expr thinking
  tag mystery
